.TH HSH 1 "May 2026" "Simple Shell Project"

.SH NAME
hsh \- simple UNIX command interpreter

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ./hsh

.SH DESCRIPTION
hsh is a simple UNIX command language interpreter written in C.

The shell can run commands in:
- Interactive mode
- Non-interactive mode

It executes commands entered by the user and searches for executable files using the PATH environment variable.

.SH FEATURES
- Execute commands
- Handle PATH
- Interactive shell
- Non-interactive shell
- Basic error handling

.SH COMPILATION
gcc -Wall -Werror -Wextra -pedantic -std=gnu89 *.c -o hsh

.SH USAGE
Run interactive mode:
.B ./hsh

Run non-interactive mode:
.B echo "/bin/ls" | ./hsh

